#: ../../source/api_reference/multimodality.rst:7
msgid ""
"vLLM is building on its multimodal capability and currently supports the "
"following `List of Multimodal Language Models "
"<https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/models/supported_models.html#list-of-"
"multimodal-language-models>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_reference/multimodality.rst:9
msgid ""
"LMCache can therefore be used to speed up inference time for all "
"multimodal models supported by vLLM. This document shows the speedup "
"improvements using LMCache for KV caching in vLLM for multimodal models."
msgstr ""

